  m_Name: Forest_Campfire_4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Game.Collectable.CollectableItem
  id: Forest_Campfire_4
  headerName: Rain
  content: "This should be a deciduous forest. Rain should fall here with regularity.
    But the world is broken now, and so the sky withholds. Finding drinking water
    has become an exercise in hope and luck \u2014 we drink only what we can find
    at whatever water source the land still offers. The trees, too, are thinning.
    Only a few species remain standing."
